A quoted item that ends on a block past its column holds no paragraph

```
> - b
>   - c
>       # h
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>b
      <ul>
        <li>c
          <h1 id="h">h</h1>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

